 "lineupRules": {
  "why": "Adam's material lineup verdicts, October 29 (docs/production/material-lineup-2026-10-29/VERDICTS.md; the Armor Kit Editor note, \"October 29 — material lineup verdicts\"). Per material: relief 0 strips a cheap procedural bump (pits, dents, peen dishes, grain), keeping the colour, shine and metalness; pattern plain removes cracks, lead lines, dots and crack-like lines; patternScale lowers the stripes on banded bone; cleanFrom keeps a cloth clean (much less blotch, cloud and grime) from that grade up, Janky may stay dirty; rolls false drops a material from the roll while it stays in the library for the Armor Kit editor.",
  "trim": {
   "plainRims": true,
   "retiredStyles": [
    "stitched"
